<title>USA: U.S. Wireless FY96 shr loss narrows.</title>
<headline>U.S. Wireless FY96 shr loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>BOULDER, Col. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr  loss	 $0.01	   loss   $2.91</p>
<p> Net  loss	 42		loss   12,273</p>
<p> Revs		1,583		    1,721</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  4,419		    4,213</p>
<p>Full company name is U.S. Wireless Data Inc</p>
<p>NOTE: The 1996 net loss included an extraordinary gain of $3.4 million from the dissolution of the company's wholly owned subsidiary, Direct Data Inc and successful restructuring of a $1.4 million liability with the company's former manufacturing supplier.</p>
